          "title": "You'll want to know: рыбалка",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "рыбалка (rybálka) — \"fishing\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "В субботу мы с папой едем на рыбалку. V subbótu my s pápoy yédem na rybálku. On Saturday Dad and I are going fishing."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine. Ехать на рыбалку — to go fishing."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "рыбалка (rybálka) is built on рыба 'fish', through рыбак 'fisherman'; EtymDB has no entry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
